<title>LITHUANIA: TRADE DEFICIT JAN-FEB 915.8 MLN LITAS.</title>
<headline>TRADE DEFICIT JAN-FEB 915.8 MLN LITAS.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuania's trade deficit in January and February was 915.8 million litas after exports of 2.159 billion litas and imports of 3.075 billion litas, the statistics department said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
